<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-27T19:31:41.526Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 19:31:41 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen continue to carry out lethal attacks across northern Nigeria, killing a Muslim cleric in northern Nigeria and multiple civilians in Plateau, including a 60‑year-old woman harvesting groundnuts. In eastern Nigeria gunmen killed at least ten people, and in the northeast a mass shooting in Binnari left dozens injured. Kidnappers abducted six residents in Kaduna's Millennium City estate and three vigilantes died in a separate Plateau incident. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNTnRKbF9zaV91aVhVa2paT1A3TTRBZFBsaThqenNjcVJYZFpJcVNGUVdybkVDZk81U2dEVENHekVZMUZjODBld3MtZnJfenhvWE9zSFlLMmM2UUdmVTdKMzhZTHRrTDU5NXFNdXowSXFiNUFkSklodjN5a2d6Rk0tTGl6UEtkcUMzOV9NalhRVFNJcC1RMjducjl1VmJNZHBjdlZNNThXTW9SMkJvbWljNkh3?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxPb0d6UDlNblo0cHJ3Sl85VDcyS09yWGRuWXRmVjZTS1lZdnh1d19uSnFyWmE0SmwxZVRqcEM1a3psWm1LX2xnaVhmYmMyQUR6RnJkWk9obDRrVk1pWExfMTNBTFhKYkN5cTlWbmVPdk5PZHQxM2xjUno3WXlQbVV0M2pmZDFnTzZVVzlpWkYwWmJxU2tz?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxPS0hmMHhWeVZPbk5NS1NVY19lX3NONjlFYUFJN0lZdDVSTkdWMFFCbkhPaXZMSjV5SGpySkpyemo0bk1yRVl4ejZMS0RaZ05tVUVSdmw3TVM0UFV6U21YYWFHNXRQZXY2YWJFMkN5eTlXSkFiUUktX3ZINzZhLXFYS3JnY0NSU0VzVWtsWHJaTXFpWVVYSEtLM3FQQUM?oc=5&quot;&gt;21st CENTURY CHRONICLE&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxPczQwWTVXcGZxOHp0X3ROSFhHUmUtZE1oRHZNR0ZIOGhXY3h5SGhkQ1BiY1lyYUpQT0lObFBLUUNqOU5IQ3dodnk5SF9kSTltU3pmZFh4RWZfYWxuV2pSVXBzdDRJYU1PbVk2TFhXb0lFWDBJZDd2ZjBOcmZxRHNGdA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latest ne